# Scratch probes that review agents write to inspect real output. They import
# node:fs and hardcode a scratchpad path, so they are never part of the suite.
**/__probe.test.*

# Throwaway end-to-end probes. Diagnosing a defect in this repo means opening
# a real browser and measuring, and the spec that does the measuring is
# written to be deleted — `zz-` marks one so it never reaches a commit and
# never sorts above a real spec in the runner's output.
apps/web/e2e/zz-*.spec.ts
